rf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Dixon County shows 2026 running short so far, with January to February at 9% of normal and February to March at 20% in 2026. In 2025, June to July came in at 193% of normal while September to October fell to 47%. October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of the 75 years since 1951. Grid 27433 had its driest year in 1976 at 52%.</p>"}
